 "protocol": {
  "_note": "M5a perception acceptance protocol, pre-registered 2026-11-19 BEFORE the revised estimator is evaluated. Evaluated by scripts/vision/replay_perception.py on recorded shadow-mode frames (validation/perception/frames/<scenario>/). Simulation benchmark only; model quantities, not clinical accuracy. Thresholds must not be loosened after seeing results; a failed gate is reported as failed.",
